      "images": []
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "alignment": "left",
      "markdown": "<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--left\">Then on June 15 at 10 a.m. PT / 1 p.m. ET I will join the <em>Pokémon GO</em> developer Q&amp;A</div>",
      "images": []
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
